      "content": "that's exactly what i was thinking. especially the part about the scripted scenario. it would explain why jason's behavior changed so suddenly, like he's just part of some setup. i'm starting to feel really paranoid about how to even talk to people anymore. if they're all in on it, i can't trust anyone. how do i even start collecting evidence without making them realize i've noticed? like, what kind of things should i be documenting to prove this is a coordinated study?",
